1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Your project lists every image in its folders.
Nothing has been looked at yet.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
To start, click Process.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
WildObserve loads its AI models.
The first time, this can take a little while.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:27,500
The models run on your own computer,
so your images never leave it.

5
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
WildObserve now looks for animals, people, and vehicles
in every image.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,500
It shows how long is left, and you can pause it at any time.
